    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“There are ways to move that the sun never got to review.”</em></p><p><strong>What the Deep Dark Taught You (1/Soma Break).</strong> As a bonus action, sink partially into shadow, earth, or stone. For up to 1 minute you gain the following while sunken:</p><ul><li>Advantage on Intrigue (Stealth) checks.</li><li>Difficult terrain costs you no extra movement.</li><li>You can move through spaces one foot wide.</li><li>Resistance to qliphothic damage.</li></ul><p>The effect ends early if you are fully submerged in running water or take sephirotic damage.</p>",
